# Start three humans with a keyboard plus Xbox and PlayStation virtual pads.
0.15 connect xbox
0.30 connect ps
0.60 click 160 350
0.90 expect setup
1.10 click 160 292
1.50 capture validation/kart-three-player-setup.png
1.90 click 160 577
2.20 expect playing
2.60 capture validation/kart-three-player.png
3.10 keydown Escape
3.25 keyup Escape
3.50 expect paused
3.80 quit end
